    """
    This test case verifies that the Maybe data type provides correct functionality like
    applying functions, converting to lazy, validation, filtering, etc., ensuring it
    complies with the expectations. It also verifies its equivalence with other Maybe instances
    and converts values to their corresponding types, Box, or Try, based on the outcome of a validation.
    """
